Mardu Energy aggro-disruption: deploy efficient threats (Ajani, Ocelot Pride, Guide of Souls, Amped Raptor, Voice of Victory), attack every turn and race their life total. Disrupt with Thoughtseize, Cabal Therapy, Orcish Bowmasters, and Swords to Plowshares; Wasteland/Karakas hit their mana. You are the AGGRESSOR: prioritize pressuring life and stripping their key piece over durdling.
